<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's National Gypsum Co Q1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Saudi's National Gypsum Co Q1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		 10.9   vs    9.9</p>
<p> Operating income	 27.2   vs   24.5</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds   199.0   vs  190.2</p>
<p>Full Name: National Gypsum Company of Saudi Arabia.</p>
<p>Note: The Riyadh-based company produces plaster and other building materials. It is listed on the Saudi stock market.</p>
</text>
